	<id>sudoku</id>
	<name>Sudoku</name>
	<summary>Play Sudoku — solo, local, no external server</summary>
	<description><![CDATA[
A native Sudoku game.

* 9×9 grid with four difficulty levels (easy, medium, hard, expert).
* Three mistakes maximum — then the game is lost.
* On a win, your time is compared against your personal best for that level.
* Restart the same grid or start a brand-new game.
* Everything runs locally. The puzzle solution never leaves the server.

No external dependencies, no telemetry, no accounts beyond your existing login.
	]]></description>
